### Trading Feature API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/v1

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### DAILY TARGET - TRADING PLAN
### ============================================

### Create Daily Target for Trading
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2025-10-20T00:00:00Z",
  "income_target": 1000000.00,
  "expense_limit": 100000.00,
  "savings_target": 50000.00,
  "notes": "Trading Plan - Scalping EURUSD & GBPUSD"
}

### Get Today's Trading Target
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/today HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### TRADING ACTIVITIES - RECORD TRADES
### ============================================

### Add Trade - WIN (Profit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/trades HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "trade_type": "win",
  "amount": 160000.00,
  "pips": 100,
  "lot_size": 0.01,
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "description": "TP hit, bullish breakout strategy",
  "trade_time": "2025-10-20T09:30:00Z"
}

### Add Trade - WIN #2
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/trades HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "trade_type": "win",
