### Get All Trades for Daily Target
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/trades HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Specific Trading Activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Trading Activity (Reverses Calculation)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### TRADING STATISTICS
### ============================================

### Get Trading Stats - Today
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Trading Stats - This Week
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/stats?date_from=2025-10-14&date_to=2025-10-20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Trading Stats - This Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/stats?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO TESTING
### ============================================

### Scenario 1: Check Target After Multiple Trades
# After adding 7 trades above, check if target is completed
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected Response:
# {
#   "actual_income": 1010000.00,
#   "actual_expense": 55000.00,
#   "actual_savings": 955000.00,
#   "remaining_income": 0.00,
#   "total_trades": 7,
#   "winning_trades": 6,
#   "losing_trades": 1,
#   "win_rate": 85.71,
#   "is_completed": true,
#   "completed_at": "2025-10-20T17:00:00Z"
# }

### Scenario 2: Bad Day (Stop Loss Hit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2025-10-21T00:00:00Z",
  "income_target": 1000000.00,
  "expense_limit": 100000.00,
  "savings_target": 50000.00,
  "notes": "Bad Market Conditions"
}

