### Check if Auto-Completed Due to Stop Loss
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Expected Response:
# {
#   "actual_income": 0.00,
#   "actual_expense": 105000.00,  // Exceeded limit!
#   "is_completed": true,  // Auto-stopped
#   "total_trades": 3,
#   "winning_trades": 0,
#   "losing_trades": 3,
#   "win_rate": 0.00
# }

### Scenario 3: Monthly Review
### Get All Daily Targets for October
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Trading Stats for October
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/trading-activities/stats?date_from=2025-10-01&date_to=2025-10-31 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Week Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/week-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Month Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/month-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### ERROR TESTING
### ============================================

### Try to Create Duplicate Daily Target (Should Return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2025-10-20T00:00:00Z",
  "income_target": 500000.00,
  "expense_limit": 50000.00,
  "savings_target": 25000.00
}

### Try to Add Trade to Completed Target (Should Return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/trades HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "trade_type": "win",
  "amount": 100000.00,
  "pips": 50,
  "lot_size": 0.01,
  "symbol": "EURUSD"
}

### Try Invalid Trade Type (Should Return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/daily-targets/1/trades HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "trade_type": "invalid",
  "amount": 100000.00,
  "pips": 50,
  "lot_size": 0.01,
  "symbol": "EURUSD"
}
